   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.15",
   "range": "1CH.2.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "83170a41",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.15#p1-83170a41",
     "text": "Jesse is said to have eight sons, {1Sa 17:12} but one might be his son by adoption.",
     "anchor": "David the seventh.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 17:12",
       "ref": "1SA.17.12"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.16",
   "range": "1CH.2.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c1f05435",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.16#p1-c1f05435",
     "text": "Elder brother to Joab, who yet got the start of him.",
     "anchor": "Abishai."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.17",
   "range": "1CH.2.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9d1a1991",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.17#p1-9d1a1991",
     "text": "See on 2Sa 17:25.",
     "anchor": "Jether the Ishmeelite.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 17:25",
       "ref": "2SA.17.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.24",
   "range": "1CH.2.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1c549b81",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.24#p1-f6b161c1",
     "text": "i.e., The prince of Tekoa. Augustus would not be called lord, but father of his country, taking great delight in that title given him by the people, and calling the commonwealth his daughter, as Macrobius {a} writeth.",
     "anchor": "The father of Tekoa"
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.24#p2-82ec4af7",
     "text": "{a} Lib. ii. cap. 5."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.26",
   "range": "1CH.2.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3b7f3d44",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.26#p1-9bb45cca",
     "text": "Besides Abijah {a} his wife. {1Ch 2:25}",
     "anchor": "Jerahmeel had also another wife.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 2:25",
       "ref": "1CH.2.25"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.26#p2-45524366",
     "text": "{a} [Sic.(?) Besides his wife who was the mother of Ahijah.] {1Ch 2:25}",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 2:25",
       "ref": "1CH.2.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.42",
   "range": "1CH.2.42",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "66742e82",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.42#p1-66742e82",
     "text": "See on 1Ch 2:24.",
     "anchor": "He was the father of Hebron.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 2:24",
       "ref": "1CH.2.24"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.54",
   "range": "1CH.2.54",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fe1eb9d2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.54#p1-9b35256e",
     "text": "i.e., The Bethlehemites.",
     "anchor": "The sons of Salma; Bethlehem"
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.54#p2-c733ef9c",
     "text": "Or, Crowns of the house of Joab. Those Netophathites, for their prowess and achievements, were Joab’s glory, his crown of rejoicing.",
     "anchor": "Ataroth, the house of Joab."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.2.55",
   "range": "1CH.2.55",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3f70dc49",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.2.55#p1-3f70dc49",
     "text": "These were public notaries: or, as some think, Text men, who took the literal interpretation, as distinct from Wise, that is, teachers of traditions, and from Disputers, that is, teachers of allegories and mysteries. See 1Co 1:20 Jer 8:9 Ezr 7:6. The first were the best of the three, and of these were the Rechabites, who being Shuchathites, that is, dwellers in tents, might dwell where they pleased: and now dwelt at Jabez, a place which seemeth to have taken its name from that good Jabez of Judah, who prayed so hard, {1Ch 4:10} having, haply, the help of these holy Kenites, the posterity of Jethro. See Jdg 1:16.",
     "anchor": "And the families of the scribes.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Co 1:20",
       "ref": "1CO.1.20"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jer 8:9",
       "ref": "JER.8.9"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ezr 7:6",
       "ref": "EZR.7.6"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 4:10",
       "ref": "1CH.4.10"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jdg 1:16",
       "ref": "JDG.1.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
